{
  "_comment": [
    "Break Room Forensics — an audit of the office refrigerator.",
    "",
    "Synthetic in the sense that matters: the subject is a joke, but every number",
    "was chosen for a code path rather than to resemble a real audit. Six columns",
    "and heavy sharing between them make this the widest and densest of the five.",
    "",
    "What the shape exercises:",
    "  - six columns, so the gap carry-over compounds across five column",
    "    boundaries rather than the two a four-column fixture reaches;",
    "  - every middle node fed by four to six upstream nodes, so the per-column",
    "    overlap sweep does real work in every single column;",
    "  - many rows collapsing onto the same adjacent pair, so link merging is",
    "    exercised throughout rather than in one place;",
    "  - the communal mayonnaise at 3g against a 96,000g lunch bag — five orders",
    "    of magnitude, so several nodes fall under the label drop threshold.",
    "",
    "Flows are grams and conserve to 480,000 exactly.",
    "",
    "Regenerate the derived files with: node tools/generate_golden.mjs"
  ],
